<title>HUNGARY: NITROIL H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF50.3MLN.</title>
<headline>NITROIL H1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT HUF50.3MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997    Jan-Dec 1996 (*)</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	74.9	vs     99.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  54.2	vs     43.0</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	50.3	vs     39.9</p>
<p>    Group net sales	    1,217.4	vs  1,689.4</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   28.7	vs     59.0</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	618.7	vs    901.3</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales    466.8	vs    679.6</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    85.6	vs     68.1</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  19.7 loss vs     43.2 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    4.1	vs	1.2</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures    23.8	vs     44.4</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income     1.0 loss vs     13.3 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			   3.6	vs	6.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Nitroil Vegyipari Termelo-Fejleszto Rt is a chemical engineering company.</p>
<p>Figures are consolidated, the 1997 figures are unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>(*) The company said it did not prepare consolidated figures for H1 1996, therefore it provided annual figures as base for comparison.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
